ifficulty = 2\n}}\n\n{{Recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cake|Cake]]\n\nThis cake can be frozen for up to 6 months. \n\n==Ingredients==\n*115 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]] or [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n*120 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]] [[Cookbook:Vegetable Oil|vegetable oil]]\n*350 g [[Cookbook:Sugar|white sugar]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n*120 ml [[Cookbook:Milk|sour milk]] or [[Cookbook:Buttermilk|buttermilk]]\n*5 ml [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla extract]]\n*250 g sifted [[Cookbook:Flour|all-purpose flour]]\n*5 g [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n*1 g ground [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n*1 g ground [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]]\n*3 g [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*20 g unsweetened [[Cookbook:Cocoa|cocoa powder]]\n*280 g grated [[Cookbook:Zucchini|zucchini]]\n*20 g ground [[Cookbook:Walnut|walnuts]]\n*40 g semisweet [[Cookbook:Chocolate Chips|chocolate chips]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#[[Cookbook:Creaming|Cream]] together butter, vegetable oil and sugar.\n#Add eggs, sour milk, and vanilla. Blend well. \n#In a separate bowl, [[Cookbook:Sifting|sift]] dry ingredients together. \n#Blend dry ingredients into the butter mixture. \n#Add grated zucchini, and mix well. \n#Spread in a greased floured 9 x 13-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] (23 x 33 cm) pan. Sprinkle walnuts and chocolate chips on top. \n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] in a preheated 325°F (165°C) oven for 45 minutes.\n\n==Notes, tips and variations==\n* To make imitation sour milk, mix ½ cup milk with 2 teaspoons lemon juice and let stand 10 minutes.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cake]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark chocolate]]\n[[Category:Recipes using zucchini]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using buttermilk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cocoa powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clove]]\n[[Category:Recipes using eg